   "source": [
    "# **Project Summary**\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Objective**\n",
    "Explore customer financial behaviour and credit-score patterns that may help Paisabazaar strengthen risk monitoring.\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Dataset**\n",
    "The dataset contains 100,000 records and 28 columns covering income, debt, credit accounts, payment delays, credit history, and credit-score categories (Good, Standard, and Poor). Customers can appear in multiple monthly records.\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Analysis**\n",
    "The notebook checks data quality and uses 20 visualisations to study individual variables, relationships between variables, and patterns across customer groups. Each chart includes its purpose, key insight, and possible business impact.\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Key Takeaways**\n",
    "Credit-score groups differ across financial and repayment-related measures. These patterns can guide further investigation into customers who may need additional support or closer review.\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Important Limitation**\n",
    "The supplied data does not include a verified fraud label or transaction-level fraud outcome. Therefore, this is a credit-behaviour risk exploration—not proof of banking fraud. Any fraud-detection use case would require confirmed fraud labels, transaction data, and further validation.\n"
   ]
  },
