   "source": [
    "# **Problem Statement**\n",
    "\n",
    "Financial service providers need to understand customer financial behaviour and identify patterns that may signal elevated credit risk or warrant further review. This project explores income, debt, credit usage, and repayment behaviour across credit-score groups. Since the supplied dataset has no verified fraud label, the analysis cannot confirm fraud; it can only highlight patterns for further investigation.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "91279e5f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### **Define Your Business Objective**\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective is to help Paisabazaar understand customer financial and repayment patterns, support responsible risk monitoring, and identify areas for further review. The findings should inform follow-up analysis—not serve as the sole basis for lending, fraud, or customer decisions.\n"
   ]
  },
