   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Variables Description"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "99350333",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- **Customer / record fields:** `ID`, `Customer_ID`, `Name`, and `SSN` identify records or people; they are not interpreted as financial drivers.\n",
    "- **Time and demographics:** `Month`, `Age`, and `Occupation` describe the monthly record, age, and occupation category.\n",
    "- **Income and obligations:** `Annual_Income`, `Monthly_Inhand_Salary`, `Num_of_Loan`, `Outstanding_Debt`, and `Total_EMI_per_month` describe income and debt burden.\n",
    "- **Credit profile:** `Num_Bank_Accounts`, `Num_Credit_Card`, `Interest_Rate`, `Credit_Mix`, `Credit_Utilization_Ratio`, `Credit_History_Age`, and `Num_Credit_Inquiries` describe account and credit-history characteristics.\n",
    "- **Payment behaviour:** `Delay_from_due_date`, `Num_of_Delayed_Payment`, `Payment_of_Min_Amount`, and `Payment_Behaviour` describe payment-related patterns.\n",
    "- **Other financial indicators:** `Changed_Credit_Limit`, `Amount_invested_monthly`, and `Monthly_Balance` describe changes and monthly financial activity.\n",
    "- **Target:** `Credit_Score` contains Good, Standard, and Poor categories."
   ]
  },
