   "source": [
    "# Work on a copy. Preserve the original records and do not drop unusual numeric values automatically.\n",
    "analysis_df = df.copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Standardize the target and selected category labels only by trimming whitespace.\n",
    "for column in analysis_df.select_dtypes(include=[\"object\", \"string\"]).columns:\n",
    "    analysis_df[column] = analysis_df[column].astype(\"string\").str.strip()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Exclude direct identifiers from relationship analysis; retain Month for temporal comparison.\n",
    "identifier_columns = [column for column in [\"ID\", \"Customer_ID\", \"Name\", \"SSN\"] if column in analysis_df.columns]\n",
    "modeling_view = analysis_df.drop(columns=identifier_columns, errors=\"ignore\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Record quality checks rather than silently removing rows.\n",
    "quality_report = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    \"check\": [\"row_count\", \"column_count\", \"exact_duplicate_rows\", \"missing_cells\", \"unique_customers\", \"credit_score_categories\"],\n",
    "    \"result\": [\n",
    "        len(analysis_df), analysis_df.shape[1], int(analysis_df.duplicated().sum()),\n",
    "        int(analysis_df.isna().sum().sum()),\n",
    "        int(analysis_df[\"Customer_ID\"].nunique()) if \"Customer_ID\" in analysis_df else \"not available\",\n",
    "        sorted(analysis_df[\"Credit_Score\"].dropna().unique().tolist()) if \"Credit_Score\" in analysis_df else \"not available\"\n",
    "    ]\n",
    "})\n",
    "display(quality_report)\n",
    "print(\"Analysis view excludes direct identifiers:\", identifier_columns)\n",
    "print(\"No rows were dropped during this EDA preparation step.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0c6d7b83",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### What manipulations were done and what insights were found?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "32b19498",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Text columns were stripped of leading/trailing whitespace, and a separate analysis view was created without direct identifiers. No rows were deleted solely because a value was large or small. This is appropriate for an exploratory credit-risk review because extreme values may be real and should be investigated against domain rules. The dataset has monthly repeated records, so customer-level independence should not be assumed. The category `NM` in `Payment_of_Min_Amount` and `No Data` in `Type_of_Loan` are retained as explicit source categories pending clarification from the data owner."
   ]
  },
