   "source": [
    "##### 1. Why did you pick this chart?\n",
    "\n",
    "A count plot is appropriate for showing the frequency of each categorical target class and checking whether the classes are balanced."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d0e006c4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "##### 2. What insight(s) were found?\n",
    "\n",
    "Standard is the largest category (53,174 records; about 53.2%), followed by Poor (28,998; about 29.0%) and Good (17,828; about 17.8%). The target is imbalanced, so overall accuracy alone would be insufficient if a future model is developed."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f20a4fee",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
